                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-[13px] max-w-[280px] mx-auto">
                    Return to RDT, paste the reddit post link into the input box at the top of the page, and hit the Download button. On Windows press Ctrl+V to paste, on Mac use Cmd+V, and on mobile a long-press brings up the paste menu. Our reddit mp4 downloader fetches both the video stream and the audio stream in parallel, converts the reddit video to mp4 with sound, and prepares your final file — usually in under two seconds for typical Reddit posts.
